        <mxCell id="app-main" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;line-height:1.55;padding:8px&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;Application · main()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#287B7D&quot;&gt;시작 및 초기화&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;HAL_Init · SystemClock_Config&lt;br&gt;HSI / 2 × PLL16 · 64 MHz&lt;br&gt;MX_GPIO_Init · MX_USART2_UART_Init&lt;br&gt;MX_I2C1_Init · MX_SPI1_Init&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color:#287B7D&quot;&gt;주기 실행 · while (1)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;HAL_GetTick() · 1 ms 시간값 조회&lt;br&gt;100 ms · BH1750_ReadLux&lt;br&gt;BMP280_ReadData · 측정값 갱신&lt;br&gt;압력 변경 시 · TM1637_DisplayDecimal&lt;br&gt;500 ms · printf 센서 로그&lt;br&gt;센싱 / UART 조건을 반복 검사하는 super-loop&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#3E8B8C;strokeWidth=3;fontFamily=WenQuanYi Zen Hei;fontSize=16;fontColor=#34475F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="260" width="430" height="440" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
